---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="404 - 找不到頁面 | Jabee's Blog"
  description="找不到您所尋找的頁面。"
>
  <div
    class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[70vh] px-4 text-center"
  >
    <h1
      class="font-black text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 select-none drop-shadow-md"
      style="font-size: clamp(8rem, 20vw, 15rem); line-height: 1;"
    >
      404
    </h1>

    <h2
      class="mt-6 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl"
    >
      迷路了嗎？
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-md mx-auto">
      Jabee 大概不會刪文或更動網址，所以大概率是打錯網址了喔。
    </p>

    <div class="mt-20">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white transition-all duration-300 bg-gray-900 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-700 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 focus:outline-none dark:bg-white dark:text-gray-900 dark:hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:shadow-gray-700/30"
      >
        <svg
          class="w-5 h-5 mr-2"
          fill="none"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          stroke="currentColor"
        >
          <path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"></path>
        </svg>
        帶我回首頁
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
